<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Macmahon wins A$20 mln mine contract.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Macmahon wins A$20 mln mine contract.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Engineering and contract mining group Macmahon Holdings Ltd said on Friday it had won its first underground mining contract in New South Wales at an existing lead and zinc mine at Cobar.</p>
<p>Macmahon said the two year agreement with Pasminco Ltd was worth in excess of A$20 million.</p>
<p>Macmahon shares closed steady at 99 cents on turnover of 685,050 shares.</p>
<p>--Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
